No game data is distributed here
--------------------------------

This repository contains no unit data, points values, characteristics or rules
text. `sources/` and `data/` are deliberately not tracked in git, and never
have been.

The dataset is built on YOUR machine, from third-party sources you download
yourself, and stays there:

  - BSData/wh40k-11e      — community-maintained catalogues
  - BSData/wh40k-11e-mfm  — mirror of the official Munitorum Field Manual

Both are community projects, independent of Games Workshop.

Facts, not rules text
---------------------

The extraction is deliberately limited to factual data: names, numeric
characteristics, points costs, keywords and the structure of build options.
Rules text is not extracted. For abilities, stratagems and detachment rules
only the NAME is kept, as a pointer back to the official publication.

If you contribute, keep it that way. A pull request that ingests rules text
will not be merged.
